  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="can you work on saturdays" data-hint="Move Can before the subject you, then keep work in its base form." data-fix="Can you work on Saturdays?" data-success-message="Correct. The availability question places Can before you and keeps work in the base form.">
    <h3>Drill 4: build the question</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Build the question. Remember: can moves in front of the subject.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="work">work</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="saturdays">Saturdays</button>
