  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="she can’t come to the meeting" data-hint="Begin with She, place can’t before the base verb come, and finish with the meeting." data-fix="She can’t come to the meeting." data-success-message="Correct. The negative sentence keeps can’t before the unchanged base verb come.">
    <h3>Drill 5: build the negative</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Build the sentence. Only can’t carries the negative.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="meeting">meeting</button>
